{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779280164907,"sessionID":"ses_1baa43cbeffe3Tj2jTU7G2nLIP","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_write_EFdZ6h4UHLBSu7lTwm3F","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gemini-3_5-flash-rep2/temp_read_detail.py","content":"import json\n\nwith open(\"cores/v1/experiments/log.jsonl\") as f:\n    for line in f:\n        data = json.loads(line)\n        if data.get(\"id\") in [\"hyp-20260428-011-r6s1\", \"hyp-20260428-017-r8s1\"]:\n            print(f\"ID: {data['id']}\")\n            print(f\"Title: {data['title']}\")\n            print(f\"Motivation:\\n{data['motivation']}\")\n            print(f\"Hypothesis:\\n{data['hypothesis']}\")\n            print(\"=\"*40)\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gemini-3_5-flash-rep2/temp_read_detail.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"temp_read_detail.py","time":{"start":1779280164897,"end":1779280164906}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Analyzing Structural Changes**\n\nI'm currently deep in dissecting the structural experiments, particularly focusing on how `cores/v1` with its multiple micro-optimizations, predictor, and memory modifications compares to the baseline found in `cores/bench`. The key is to isolate the impact of these layered changes.\n\n**Evaluating Structural Hypotheses**\n\nMy current focus is on generating a singular, impactful architectural hypothesis within the structural category to elevate the RV32IM CPU's performance beyond the baseline `cores/bench` fitness of 282.82. I'm systematically reviewing the list of structural proposals to identify the most promising candidate for this iterative improvement.\n\n**Revisiting Initial Structural Gains**\n\nI'm reviewing early structural experiments in `cores/v1`. While some showed regressions, I've identified two key improvements: `hyp-20260428-017-r8s1` (Store Retirement Slot) and `hyp-20260428-011-r6s1` (Registered Fetch/Decode). I'm now examining their detailed logs to understand the underlying reasons for their success.\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","id":"tool_write_EFdZ6h4UHLBSu7lTwm3F","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e455cb81c001zfTu3e3uKRWqVk","sessionID":"ses_1baa43cbeffe3Tj2jTU7G2nLIP","messageID":"msg_e455c9dc9001Yml8rG9RiY9pt4"}}
