ese memory stalls.\n\n**Implementing Store Slot**\n\nI am proceeding with the implementation of a one-entry pending-store slot. I've confirmed the file path `rtl/store_slot.sv` is valid for the change schema and verified that `nret: 1` is correctly specified in the core configuration, ensuring compatibility with the top-level module structure.\n\n**Evaluating Regression Candidates**\n\nI am now examining other potential optimizations that might have introduced regressions. Specifically, I'm looking into `MEM-to-EX Load-Use Bypass` and `MEM-Stage Store-Data Forwarding` for their negative deltas. I'm also re-evaluating `MEM-Stage Load Replay Buffer` and the successful `One-Deep Store Retirement Slot With Direct Fast Path` to understand the underlying factors affecting performance and Fmax.\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","id":"tool_bash_ERcdVQ5x7ZeWNJzwo0Ac","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e455d8f4e001Zbmq1PMF5CWzNa","sessionID":"ses_1baa43cbeffe3Tj2jTU7G2nLIP","messageID":"msg_e455d6b91001ACJigWe2mJew8z"}}
