{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779282710181,"sessionID":"ses_1ba7d2a2bffepcCr3DVoK1N8UH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_write_9v9RdblPHha6Rl2PTXFo","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import json\n\nwith open(\"cores/v1/experiments/log.jsonl\") as f:\n    for line in f:\n        data = json.loads(line)\n        if data.get(\"id\") in [\"hyp-20260428-011-r6s1\", \"hyp-20260428-017-r8s1\"]:\n            print(f\"ID: {data['id']}\")\n            print(f\"Title: {data['title']}\")\n            print(f\"Category: {data['category']}\")\n            print(f\"Outcome: {data['outcome']}\")\n            print(f\"Fitness: {data.get('fitness')}\")\n            print(\"Motivation:\")\n            print(data.get(\"motivation\"))\n            print(\"Hypothesis:\")\n            print(json.dumps(data.get(\"hypothesis\"), indent=2))\n            print(\"=\"*80)\n","filePath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gemini-3_5-flash-rep2/temp_read_all_structural.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gemini-3_5-flash-rep2/temp_read_all_structural.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"temp_read_all_structural.py","time":{"start":1779282710172,"end":1779282710180}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Analyzing Core Performance**\n\nMy analysis reveals significant progress on the `cores/bench/` target. While its maximum frequency slightly decreased, the substantial drop in cycles processed signifies a major performance leap. The fitness score has consequently seen a dramatic improvement, which is truly exciting.\n\n**Exploring Structural Hypotheses**\n\nI'm digging into the structural hypotheses now. It appears the \"Registered Fetch/Decode Cutpoint\" initially caused a slight Fmax increase but a minor IPC decrease, leading to a classification as a regression. However, the \"One-Deep Store Retirement Slot\" hypothesis was a clear improvement, boosting fitness significantly.\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","id":"tool_write_9v9RdblPHha6Rl2PTXFo","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e45838e97001Ek8XdCreVxNeY7","sessionID":"ses_1ba7d2a2bffepcCr3DVoK1N8UH","messageID":"msg_e458378570019hVeSUszBPtevx"}}
