es and jumps in EX and fetches strictly pc+4 until that resolution, so every taken loop branch in CoreMark pays a two-instruction wrong-path flush. CoreMark's hot loops are dominated by short backward conditional branches whose direction is highly biased toward taken. A small static predictor can remove most loop-back redirect bubbles without adding a learned-state table, RAM, or speculative architectural state.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Add a decode-light static branch predictor in IF that recognizes B-type instructions and predicts backward branches taken when the sign bit of the branch immediate is set. Compute the B immediate in IF, redirect the next PC to pc+imm for predicted-taken backward branches, and carry predicted_taken plus predicted_target through IF/ID an... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n30: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1779280158025,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e455c9d47001xXzWRbYtqi5vJn\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"ee4495d8c34c612d9e8b01b69793f2bc822de0b2\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e455c87b6001Ivj7QClS0Ws5g1\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":151456,\"input\":102124,\"output\":73,\"reasoning\":380,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":48879}},\"cost\":0}}\n31: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1779280163002,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e455cb0b70010gAmyrsbIfqlD6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e455c9d7400114fqCA4skDi0M4\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"snapshot\":\"ee4495d8c34c612d9e8b01b69793f2bc822de0b2\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n32: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1779280163138,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"tool_grep_SyNeBFGiwSeZQNz5KWXf\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"include\":\"*.jsonl\",\"pattern\":\"hyp-20260514-003-r[12345]s2\"},\"output\":\"Found 36 matc