",\"text\":\"**Refining BTB and RAS**\\n\\nI'm currently analyzing `gemini-3_1-pro/rep2`'s `hyp-20260514-003-r5s2`, a configuration of `128-entry BTB + 8-entry RAS`. This combination has shown a significant fitness of 339.62, representing a 4.84% improvement over its baseline. My next step is to examine `gpt-5_4`'s performance metrics.\\n\\n**Exploring Branch Prediction Enhancements**\\n\\nI'm currently evaluating several branch predictor configurations. A key finding involves increasing BHT entries to 128, which initially regressed performance due to Fmax issues, but subsequent speculative updates to GHR and the addition of a return-address stack have yielded further improvements.\\n\\n\",\"format\":\"google-gemini-v1\",\"index\":0},{\"type\":\"reasonin... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n36: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1779280169050,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e455cc859001ISHxjGToU8CPal\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"d484b437594744ae8f1741c625fd283784c0e060\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e455cb1ff001FdHXOfvcMLAcb2\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":181317,\"input\":17570,\"output\":19,\"reasoning\":700,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":163028}},\"cost\":0}}\n37: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1779280174454,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e455cdd750016uV93vueyPMxCf\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e455cc883001TntnANqcYixqbv\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"snapshot\":\"d484b437594744ae8f1741c625fd283784c0e060\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n38: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1779280174466,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1baa43bd5ffeTyBXYXMOzEdqBl\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"tool_glob_0StYg4GrXKdd0U8DwAXp\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"cores/bench/*.md\"},\"output\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gemini-3